# Device screenshots. `scripts/kddss <name>` writes ./<name>.png in the cwd,
# which is the repo root when it is run from a deploy — so a verification
# screenshot dirtied the tree and the NEXT declared deploy step refused to
# publish from it (sprint 041's own Phase 7, on its first declared run).
# Anchored to the root on purpose: docs/images/*.png are tracked and stay so.
/*.png

.env

build-*/
CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
